Plandeck grows out of planning-with-files' core idea: durable, crash-proof plans
on disk that survive context loss and /clear, plus a deterministic completion
gate. Plandeck is the visual, dependency-aware evolution of that idea. The board
server, the YAML reader, the intelligence layer, and the rendering are Plandeck's
own.
